Agentic AI tools like ChatGPT's Agent Mode can complete travel bookings dir=
ectly with OTAs,=20
potentially reducing the need for travelers to visit OTA websites. There ar=
e major concerns that=20
agentic AI could diminish OTAs' ability to cross-sell additional services, =
grow loyalty programs,=20
and generate advertising revenue. OTAs are developing their own AI-powered =
features to compete, but=20
risk losing direct customer relationships if travelers increasingly rely on=
 chatbot platforms.

